From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] ui-egui: translate the AutoSave toggle, the More and Share menus, the Comments pane and the status bar statistics

Hengines task 2. Host-mode Sheets screens (uz-Latn, ru) still drew English: the AutoSave toggle and its tooltip, the title bar's More menu (New Workbook, Open, Save As, Sort A to Z, Calculate Now, Print), the Share menu (Export as PDF, Save a Copy as Excel Workbook, Export as CSV, Export as Web Page), the pane titles and the Comments pane (empty text, Resolved, Delete, Reopen/Resolve, Send, Reply), the status bar's Sum/Count/Average and the view-mode tooltips. Each literal now goes through the language's tr(); the strings no upstream table holds are new catalog rows (OWN_GRID_HE in xtask/src/i18n/extract.rs; i18n/gridcraft.tsv, agent-reviewed 2026-11-09).

---

